5. Real-life scenario se poora connection samjho

Maan lo aapki Kubernetes par deployed website slow ho gayi.

Node Exporter batata hai ki worker node ka CPU usage high hai.

Prometheus metrics scrape karke store karta hai aur CPU query se high usage identify kiya ja sakta hai.

Grafana dashboard par CPU graph dikhata hai.

Alertmanager, agar configured alert rule fire kare, toh on-call engineer ko notification bhejta hai.

Application logs mein problem ka reason dhoondhne ke liye log agent → Loki → Grafana pipeline use hoti hai.

Isse aapko do alag sawaalon ka answer milta hai:

Metrics: Problem kab hui aur system kitna affect hua?

Logs: Application ne error kya diya aur possible reason kya tha?

